{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a vibrant hub of music, movement, and creative energy, Canvas City is now a sterilized sprawl of luxury apartments, corporate towers, and silent streets. Public art is outlawed. Music permits are impossible to obtain. Citizens drift through life, silent and uninspired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But from the cracks in the pavement, a new wave is rising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crews of dancers, musicians, and graffiti artists are reclaiming the streets, forming the underground league of Spark Skating and battling for territory, expression, and change. Your crew is the newest challenger: small, scrappy, and full of potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks. Earn your following. Spark a movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/c2205e8815d85e5c69df4d7647b24bed.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/c2205e8815d85e5c69df4d7647b24bed.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/c2205e8815d85e5c69df4d7647b24bed.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Own the Streets with Style-Based Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is more than positioning; it\u2019s performance. Use the city\u2019s rails, ramps, and vertical terrain to chain together tricks mid-turn. Earn Style Points that fuel your strongest abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows MC, Star and Shade performing air tricks on vert ramps and kickers, and Star performing a flaming rail grind\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag the Map, Shift the Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag spots scattered across each level aren\u2019t just decoration - they\u2019re targets. Tag them to claim territory and generate Style Points for your crew, but be ready to defend your mark from rival gangs aiming to wipe your name from the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows Fire Starter characters Hop, Shade and MC tagging billboards in levels\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Off Against Rivals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each district is claimed by a different crew with their own agenda - from corporate-sponsored squads to fame-hungry influencers and chaotic performance artists. Outsmart their tactics and win the respect of the audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows Hop jumping in the air to perform a dance attack, shows Star doing an attack on her bass guitar and effecting two enemy Taggers, shows Hop perform a dance move that damages three enemies\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a team of four and expand your roster as you progress. Every crew member has a unique style and skillset. Mix and match classes, tricks, and trinkets to create your perfect loadout for each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/3cda9743e835e57469aba31fe629931a.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/3cda9743e835e57469aba31fe629931a.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/3cda9743e835e57469aba31fe629931a.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Story and Setting: </strong>\u00a0Uncover the truth behind Canvas City\u2019s cultural crackdown in a campaign packed with rival crews, mysterious figures, and evolving characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Over 80 Unique Abilities &amp; Tricks: </strong>\u00a0Equip your crew with a wide range of combat powers - buffs, debuffs, zone control, mobility tricks, and more. Every character brings something different to the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and Customize Your Team:\u00a0</strong>Unlock 12 recruitable characters across the campaign. Each one has a distinct style, backstory, and ability choices to shape to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Bonus Objectives and Build Your Garage:\u00a0</strong>Complete side goals to earn rare upgrades, unlock new items, and fill out your Garage - your crew\u2019s hub for loadouts, backstories, and pre-mission planning.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Missions to Climb the Rankings: </strong>Revisit  levels to refine your strategy, maximize your score, and earn the highest possible rank on every stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3226830?t=1773181219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/cb31b9108b1416c315531bd3a0a6a26d37882852/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773181219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/164f9162721596c6b6bc5b85fce9ec073e9cd786/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773181219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/164f9162721596c6b6bc5b85fce9ec073e9cd786/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773181219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Cust