t\u2019s performance. Use the city\u2019s rails, ramps, and vertical terrain to chain together tricks mid-turn. Earn Style Points that fuel your strongest abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows MC, Star and Shade performing air tricks on vert ramps and kickers, and Star performing a flaming rail grind\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/f9b8e0f21f58b81a4807093cf066a849.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag the Map, Shift the Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag spots scattered across each level aren\u2019t just decoration - they\u2019re targets. Tag them to claim territory and generate Style Points for your crew, but be ready to defend your mark from rival gangs aiming to wipe your name from the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows Fire Starter characters Hop, Shade and MC tagging billboards in levels\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4231ce1f4ba7f458700a6c40dfe1bb36.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Off Against Rivals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each district is claimed by a different crew with their own agenda - from corporate-sponsored squads to fame-hungry influencers and chaotic performance artists. Outsmart their tactics and win the respect of the audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" aria-label=\"Shows Hop jumping in the air to perform a dance attack, shows Star doing an attack on her bass guitar and effecting two enemy Taggers, shows Hop perform a dance move that damages three enemies\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/4cb6033986a8fa5bcf65bb81c73e2b09.mp4?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a team of four and expand your roster as you progress. Every crew member has a unique style and skillset. Mix and match classes, tricks, and trinkets to create your perfect loadout for each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/3cda9743e835e57469aba31fe629931a.poster.avif?t=1773181219\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/extras/3cda9743e835e57469aba31fe629931a.webm?t=1773181219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">