f3469fa25/ss_5eb8cdea6728c6ce2fe4a581faf2851f3469fa25.600x338.jpg?t=1773181219"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/627003d75779529a6ef39e1d022a3e19db1deb06/ss_627003d75779529a6ef39e1d022a3e19db1deb06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773181219","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/627003d75779529a6ef39e1d022a3e19db1deb06/ss_627003d75779529a6ef39e1d022a3e19db1deb06.600x338.jpg?t=1773181219"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/77a5f8d9b6ac9feed698baf1c0f2b44877d22264/ss_77a5f8d9b6ac9feed698baf1c0f2b44877d22264.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773181219","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/77a5f8d9b6ac9feed698baf1c0f2b44877d22264/ss_77a5f8d9b6ac9feed698baf1c0f2b44877d22264.600x338.jpg?t=1773181219"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/4970ff59d3a8698cbce146728e880fb26945d15c/ss_4970ff59d3a8698cbce146728e880fb26945d15c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773181219","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226830/4970ff59d3a8698cbce146728e880fb26945d15c/ss_4970ff59d3a8698cbce146728e880fb26945d15c.600x338.jpg?t=1773181219"}],"short_description":"Canvas City is a turn-based tactics RPG of rebellion on rollerblades. Lead a crew of skaters and street artists rising up against an oppressive regime. Each map is a battleground and a canvas, where your actions shift control, leave your mark, and shape the city\u2019s future.","steam_appid":3226830,"support_info":{"email":"support@disc2games.com","url":"https://disc2games.com/contact/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://disc2games.com/"}